#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"With \"Start Minimized\" and \"Fullscreen\" this is the classic cast-target "
"setup: the app waits out of the way, plays fullscreen when something casts "
"to it, and goes back to waiting when the video ends or you press Q."
msgstr ""
"Con \"Avvia minimizzato\" e \"Schermo intero\" si ottiene la classica "
"configurazione di destinazione per la trasmissione: l'applicazione rimane "
"inattiva, riproduce a schermo intero quando viene trasmesso un contenuto e "
"torna in modalità di attesa al termine del video o quando si preme il tasto "
"Q."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off means command-line mode: no window, no system tray and no settings "
"screen, so the only way back is editing conf.json by hand. It is not how you "
"get MPV's own on-screen controls — \"Player Controls Style\" under Interface "
"does that."
msgstr ""
"\"Off\" significa modalità riga di comando: nessuna finestra, nessuna area "
"di notifica e nessuna schermata delle impostazioni, quindi l'unico modo per "
"tornare alla modalità normale è modificare manualmente il file conf.json. "
"Non è così che si ottengono i controlli a schermo di MPV: per quello si usa "
"la sezione \"Stile controlli lettore\" sotto Interfaccia."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Show only what is cast to this machine — the library, including this "
"settings screen, can't be reached from here. Without a system tray icon the "
"only way back is editing conf.json. For the classic cast-target setup you "
"want the Interface settings instead; this is for a shared TV nobody should "
"be able to browse from."
msgstr ""
"Mostra solo i contenuti trasmessi a questo dispositivo: la libreria, inclusa "
"questa schermata delle impostazioni, non è accessibile da qui. Senza "
"un'icona nella barra delle applicazioni, l'unico modo per tornare indietro è "
"modificare il file conf.json. Per la configurazione classica del target di "
"trasmissione, è necessario accedere alle impostazioni dell'interfaccia; "
"questa opzione è pensata per una TV condivisa da cui nessuno dovrebbe essere "
"in grado di navigare."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Requires restart to change. MPV keybinds are used by default. Press ENTER "
#| "to drive the player controls by keyboard."
msgid ""
"Requires restart to change. MPV keybinds are used by default. Press ENTER to "
"drive the player controls by keyboard. \"No player controls\" leaves "
"playback bare; the library, the keyboard shortcuts and the menu key still "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Richiede il riavvio per applicare le modifiche. Per impostazione predefinita "
"vengono utilizzati i tasti di scelta rapida MPV. Premi INVIO per controllare "
"il lettore tramite tastiera."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Pixels one wheel notch scrolls. On a grid this is rounded so a whole number "
"of notches spans one row, whichever scroll mode you are in — a trackpad or "
"trackball never leaves you a sliver of a row off. Raise it to scroll faster, "
"lower it for finer control."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Continuous\" scrolls by pixels and lands wherever the wheel puts it; it "
"lines rows up by itself if the display cannot keep up. Pick \"Aligned to "
"rows\" if scrolling still stutters — on a very large display, a slow or "
"remote one, or with an external MPV. Pick \"One row per notch\" to move a "
"whole row (or one home-screen section) at a time."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid "Discord Rich Presence. Takes effect after a restart."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave this to Default unless setting up passthrough. Note some audio servers "
"like Pipewire don't like passthrough and will need to be disabled for a card "
"before it'll let *any* audio through in passthrough mode. In my tests I got "
"silence otherwise, but results may vary."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Stop anything else using the device while playing. Needed for passthrough on "
"some systems, and it means other applications will be silent."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Page the library and music tile grids instead of scrolling: each page is one "
"screenful with First / Previous / Next / Last controls and a page number you "
"can type into. Easier than precise scrolling on a trackpad."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Palette, glow, cover style and default cover size. Colours change "
"immediately; cover and heading sizes take effect after a restart."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Overrides the theme's cover size. Applies immediately, and is also on the "
"View menu of any library."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The controls have to stay legible over any frame. \"None\" gives the text a "
"drop shadow instead of shading the picture behind it."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Hide unless hovered\" keeps them up only while the pointer is on them, "
"paused or not."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"0 hides them as soon as the pointer is not on them, and forces \"Hide unless "
"hovered\"."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"During playback only — in the library those buttons stay Back and Forward. "
"Off by default because they are easy to hit by accident on some mice. Takes "
"effect after a restart."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Takes effect after a restart. \"Follow display\" uses the scale your desktop "
"reports, which is 100% on X11."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Default\" changes nothing and lets MPV (and your own mpv.conf) decide. "
"Pick a mode only if you are sending audio to a receiver."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Audio your receiver can't be sent directly is encoded to AC3, which is the "
"only way surround fits down an optical cable. Turn this off if the encoder "
"causes audio delay — those tracks become stereo instead."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"hq\" offers heavier profiles. Pick it if you have a fast graphics card."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave on Automatic unless video breaks when a profile is loaded. This only "
"applies while a profile is active, and OpenGL can cost you HDR output."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Evens out loud effects and quiet dialogue. This turns passthrough off while "
"it is enabled, because the volume has to be adjusted before your receiver "
"gets the audio."
msgstr ""

